# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#  No photographs or video in this repository.
#
#  The school's pictures show its building, its grounds and its
#  children. They are kept out of version control deliberately: this
#  repository is public, and a picture committed even once stays in the
#  git history for ever, even if the file is deleted afterwards.
#
#  The page ships with a drawn placeholder instead. To see it with the
#  real pictures, copy them into assets/img/ on your own machine — git
#  will ignore them, so they can never be pushed by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# photographs
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.webp
*.avif
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.heic

# video
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.avi
*.mkv

# Note: .svg is NOT ignored. The crest and the building stand-in are
# drawings, not photographs, so they belong in the repository.

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
node_modules/
